{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"稻盛和夫·生平与时代","stage":"DONE","category":"kazuo-inamori","categoryLabel":"稻盛和夫","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.63,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/10_kazuo-inamori/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"生平与时代\">生平与时代</h1><p>本卷是稻盛和夫人物 hub 的<strong>第 1 卷·传记主线</strong>，按时间顺序还原&quot;经营之圣&quot;的一生：从一九三二年鹿儿岛贫病交加的少年，到松风工业的精神觉醒，到二十七岁创办京瓷、五十二岁创办第二电电（KDDI），再到七十八岁临危受命、零报酬拯救破产的日本航空，最后于二〇二二年以九十岁辞世。本卷回答的是&quot;<strong>他经历了什么、何时、与谁</strong>&quot;，为理解其思想、方法与影响提供事实底座。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷-分工边界\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷：分工边界</h2><p>本 hub 只讲<strong>生平事实与时间线</strong>；同一人物的思想内核、方法体系、著作、影响与争议，分属其余五卷，避免重复展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>与本卷的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 · 生平与时代（本卷）</td>\n<td>何时、何地、何事的传记主线</td>\n<td>事实底座</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 · <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>三大事业、阿米巴经营、经营哲学体系</td>\n<td>把生平事件抽象为贡献</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 · <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>人生方程式、敬天爱人、六项精进</td>\n<td>把人生感悟抽象为方法论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 · <a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a></td>\n<td>《活法》《干法》《经营为何需要哲学》等</td>\n<td>思想的文本载体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 · <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>对日本/全球企业界、盛和塾、精神遗产</td>\n<td>生平结束后的延续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6 · <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>理想与现实、神秘主义之辩、综合评价</td>\n<td>对生平与思想的批判性反思</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>凡涉及&quot;为什么这套哲学有效&quot;&quot;它的边界与争议&quot;，本卷只给指针、不展开，请移步对应卷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置</strong>：无。本卷是进入整个稻盛 hub 的最佳入口，建议第一个读。</li>\n<li><strong>本卷内顺序</strong>（强烈建议按时间线顺读，后篇依赖前篇的因果铺垫）：<ol>\n<li><a href=\"early-life-and-struggle/childhood-and-setbacks\">童年与挫折</a> — 失败连续剧如何写定底层归因</li>\n<li><a href=\"early-life-and-struggle/finding-purpose-in-work\">在工作中找到使命</a> — 松风工业的心态反转与镁橄榄石</li>\n<li><a href=\"founding-kyocera/the-birth-of-kyocera\">京瓷的诞生</a> — 1959 年的血判状与&quot;何谓正确&quot;</li>\n<li><a href=\"founding-kyocera/building-a-great-company\">缔造卓越的企业</a> — 技术、阿米巴、哲学三轮驱动</li>\n<li><a href=\"later-years-and-jal/kddi-and-second-venture\">创办第二电电</a> — 利他动机的对照实验</li>\n<li><a href=\"later-years-and-jal/saving-japan-airlines\">拯救日本航空</a> — 哲学操作系统的压力测试满分</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li><strong>读完后的去向</strong>：想懂&quot;为什么有效&quot;→ 第 3 卷 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>；想看体系化的经营贡献 → 第 2 卷 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>；想做批判性思考 → 第 6 卷 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"贯穿全卷的主线\">贯穿全卷的主线</h2><p>三章六篇其实在反复演示同一件事：稻盛把少年时悟出的一套底层算法（&quot;灾难因心而起 → 改变自己 → 全力投入 → 以利他为动机&quot;），在难度递增的三个战场上逐级放大并验证——本行（京瓷）、陌生行业（第二电电）、破产重整（日航）。读传记的价值，正在于看清&quot;经营之圣&quot;并非天降奇才，而是同一套可学、可传的哲学被一生持续复利的结果。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"early-life-and-struggle","title":"早年与磨难","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/life-and-times/early-life-and-struggle","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"childhood-and-setbacks","title":"童年与挫折","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/life-and-times/early-life-and-struggle/childhood-and-setbacks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"finding-purpose-in-work","title":"在工作中找到使命","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/life-and-times/early-life-and-struggle/finding-purpose-in-work"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"founding-kyocera","title":"创立京瓷","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/life-and-times/founding-kyocera","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-birth-of-kyocera","title":"京瓷的诞生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/life-and-times/founding-kyocera/the-birth-of-kyocera"},{"seq":2,"slug":"building-a-great-company","title":"缔造卓越的企业","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/life-and-times/founding-kyocera/building-a-great-company"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"later-years-and-jal","title":"晚年与重建日航","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/life-and-times/later-years-and-jal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kddi-and-second-venture","title":"创办第二电电","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/life-and-times/later-years-and-jal/kddi-and-second-venture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"saving-japan-airlines","title":"拯救日本航空","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/life-and-times/later-years-and-jal/saving-japan-airlines"}]}]}